extends layout
include mixins

block content
  +heading(title)
  +greeting(firstName)
  p(style="margin:0 0 20px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#000909;")
    | A sensitive action was just taken in the Fiam operations console.
  +detailsCard()
    +row('Action', title)
    +row('By', actor)
    +row('Affects', target)
    +row('Time', occurredAt)
    +row('IP address', ipAddress)
  p(style="margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#7F7F7F;")
    | If you don't recognise this, sign in to the console, review the audit log, and reset the affected account's access.
